. * -------- Outcome: 7-point "position of women" index --------------
. 
. * non-reverse items
. foreach v in plj0621 plj0622 {
  2.     recode `v' (-1 -2 -3 -5 = .)                // set missings to .
  3.     gen   r_`v' = `v'                           // reverse: here not neces
